{"unit":5,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 5","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 5 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Stuff and things</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx256\">Thirty questions on Unit 5 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u5\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u5r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r102\">Choose the correct article.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She has &hellip; antique table in the hall.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">an</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">I need a new phone. &hellip; one I have is broken.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">no article</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; money is not everything.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">The</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">(no article)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He works in &hellip; laboratory near the station. I have never been there.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">no article</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r103\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">There isn&rsquo;t <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"any\" data-why=\"Negative sentence, uncountable noun: <b>any</b> milk.\"> milk left.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">How <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"much\" data-why=\"<i>Money</i> is uncountable: <b>how much</b>.\"> money do you owe him?</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">I only have <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"a\" data-why=\"<b>A few</b> coins &mdash; a small number, but some.\"> few coins left.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r104\">Choose the correct quantifier.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">There are too &hellip; people in this queue.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a few</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">I can&rsquo;t come &mdash; I don&rsquo;t have &hellip; time.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">enough</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">much</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">She saved &hellip; little every month and now she can afford a flat.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">(nothing)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"Before a vowel sound we use <b>an</b>: <i>an old wallet</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">bought</span> <span class=\"ew\">a</span> <span class=\"ew\">old</span> <span class=\"ew\">wallet</span> <span class=\"ew\">at</span> <span class=\"ew\">the</span> <span class=\"ew\">market</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"<i>Coins</i> can be counted: <b>How many coins</b>.\"><span class=\"ew\">How</span> <span class=\"ew\">much</span> <span class=\"ew\">coins</span> <span class=\"ew\">have</span> <span class=\"ew\">you</span> <span class=\"ew\">got</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">There is a small amount of sugar left.<br>There is <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"a little sugar left|a little sugar\" data-why=\"Uncountable, small amount, positive: <b>a little sugar</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">The shop doesn&rsquo;t have many customers.<br>The shop has <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"few customers|not many customers\" data-why=\"Countable, small number, negative feeling: <b>few customers</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u5r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">I can&rsquo;t <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"afford\" data-why=\"<b>Afford</b> = have enough money to pay for something.\"> a new car this year.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">He borrowed too much and now he is in <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"debt\" data-why=\"<b>Debt</b> = money that you owe.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">If the jacket doesn&rsquo;t fit, you can ask for a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"refund\" data-why=\"A <b>refund</b> is money given back when you return something.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">The bag is heavy because it is made of real <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"leather\" data-why=\"<b>Leather</b> is strong material made from animal skin.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">She has a large <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"collection\" data-why=\"A <b>collection</b> is a group of similar things gathered over time.\"> of old coins.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">The table is very old and worth a lot of money. It is &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">brand new</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an antique</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">minimalist</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">You must pay this &hellip; before the end of the month.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">bill</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">coin</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">balance</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">There is almost nothing in the room. It is very &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">fashionable</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">minimalist</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">valuable</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are materials. <b>Shiny</b> describes a surface.\"><span class=\"ew\">leather</span> <span class=\"ew\">metal</span> <span class=\"ew\">plastic</span> <span class=\"ew\">shiny</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are things you pay. A <b>statistic</b> is a number.\"><span class=\"ew\">bill</span> <span class=\"ew\">rent</span> <span class=\"ew\">fee</span> <span class=\"ew\">statistic</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u5r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">I don&rsquo;t know the word. It&rsquo;s &hellip; tool you use in the kitchen.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a kind of</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a kind</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">kind of a</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">It&rsquo;s &hellip; opening bottles.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">used for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">used to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">using for</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">Which line opens a formal complaint email?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;Hi, I have a problem with my order.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;I am writing to complain about an order I received on 3 May.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;Your shop is terrible.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">I would like a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"refund\" data-why=\"<b>I&rsquo;d like a refund</b> &mdash; asking for your money back rather than a replacement.\"> rather than a replacement.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">I look <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"forward\" data-why=\"<b>I look forward to your reply</b> &mdash; the standard formal closing.\"> to your reply.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u5r114\">Put the three parts of the complaint email in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">I look forward to your reply. Yours faithfully, A. Nurlan</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Dear Sir or Madam,</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">I am writing to complain about an order I received on 3 May.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}